# Local LAN distribution dir: built APK/LGX, the served repo index, and — most
# importantly — the TLS material from scripts/gen-lan-certs.sh. dist/certs holds
# CA + server PRIVATE KEYS. This repo is public; none of it may ever be pushed.
dist/

# Signing / secrets, wherever they land. The release keystore lives OUTSIDE this
# repo (~/keystores) with its passwords in ~/.gradle/gradle.properties, and must
# stay there: losing or leaking it means the app can never be updated again.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
